# Commandment

Evaluation contract for this kernel. All five sections below are
mandatory and enforced by kernel_languages/contract.py::validate_commandment.

## Setup

```bash
export PYTHONPATH="{{ repo_root }}:${PYTHONPATH:-}"
export GEAK_WORK_DIR="{{ repo_root }}"
{% if inner_kernel -%}
# Inner-kernel mode: stage the kernel + a wrapper into GEAK_WORK_DIR so
# relative imports work the way the harness expects.
mkdir -p "${GEAK_WORK_DIR}/_work"
cp "{{ kernel_path }}" "${GEAK_WORK_DIR}/_work/kernel.py"
touch "${GEAK_WORK_DIR}/_work/__init__.py"
{%- endif %}
```

## Correctness

```bash
python3 {{ harness_path }} --correctness
```

## Benchmark

```bash
python3 {{ harness_path }} --benchmark
```

## Full Benchmark

```bash
python3 {{ harness_path }} --full-benchmark
```

## Profile

```bash
kernel-profile "python3 {{ harness_path }} --profile" \
  --gpu-devices ${GEAK_GPU_DEVICE:-0} \
  --replays {{ profile_replays | default(3) }} \
  --json -o ${GEAK_WORK_DIR}/profile.json
```
